{
  "hypothesis": "Optimize the k-Nearest Neighbors (KNN) algorithm by using SIMD instructions to speed up the distance calculations and sorting.",
  "transformations": [
    "Added SIMD intrinsics for distance calculations.",
    "Optimized the sorting step using SIMD for faster comparison and swapping."
